Helm chart：貼一個 HelmChart 資源的 YAML 就會裝（k3s 內建 Helm 控制器），例如：\napiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\nkind: HelmChart\nmetadata: {name: wordpress, namespace: kube-system}\nspec: {repo: https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami, chart: wordpress, targetNamespace: web, createNamespace: true}	Helm chart: HelmChart 리소스의 YAML을 붙여넣으면 설치됩니다 (k3s에는 Helm 컨트롤러가 내장되어 있습니다). 예:\napiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\nkind: HelmChart\nmetadata: {name: wordpress, namespace: kube-system}\nspec: {repo: https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami, chart: wordpress, targetNamespace: web, createNamespace: true}
